{
  "uid": "incident-resolution",
  "title": "Resolução de Incidentes — Observabilidade",
  "tags": ["observability", "demo", "lgtm"],
  "timezone": "browser",
  "schemaVersion": 39,
  "version": 2,
  "refresh": "5s",
  "graphTooltip": 1,
  "time": { "from": "now-15m", "to": "now" },
  "panels": [
    {
      "id": 1,
      "type": "text",
      "title": "Guia Rápido da Demonstração (Fluxo de Investigação e Comandos de Teste)",
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 24, "x": 0, "y": 0 },
      "options": {
        "mode": "markdown",
        "content": "### Jornada de Diagnóstico: **1. Sintoma (Métricas)** ➔ **2. Isolamento (Trace via Exemplar ★)** ➔ **3. Contexto (Logs no Loki)** ➔ **4. Código (Flamegraph no Pyroscope)**\n| Cenário | Comportamento | Como identificar no Dashboard | Comando para forçar no terminal |\n| :--- | :--- | :--- | :--- |\n| 🟢 **fast** (40%) | Resposta rápida (50–200ms), HTTP 200 | Barras verdes no gráfico de tráfego | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/checkout?scenario=fast\"` |\n| 🟡 **io** (20%) | Espera de 1.5s–3.0s (Gateway lento), HTTP 200 | P95 sobe, Trace longo em `payment.io`, **Flamegraph limpo** | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/checkout?scenario=io\"` |\n| 🔴 **db** (20%) | Erro HTTP 500 (Pool de banco esgotado) | Taxa 5xx sobe, Log **ERROR** `Database connection timeout` | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/checkout?scenario=db\"` |\n| 🟣 **cpu** (20%) | Loop pesado de antifraude (0.5s–1.0s, >0.8s dá 500) | Função `run_heavy_fraud_check` **domina o Flamegraph de CPU** | `curl -X POST \"http://localhost:8000/checkout?scenario=cpu\"` |"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1A. Volume de Tráfego (/payment)",
      "description": "Total de requisições por segundo processadas pelo serviço de pagamento.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 0, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "decimals": 2,
          "color": { "mode": "fixed", "fixedColor": "blue" }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "req/s"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1B. Taxa de Erros HTTP 5xx (Sintoma de Falha)",
      "description": "Soma das falhas de banco (db = 20%) + falhas de antifraude que passam de 0.8s (cpu = ~8%).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 8, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "percent",
          "decimals": 1,
          "min": 0,
          "max": 100,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 15 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 35 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "background",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "100 * sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\",status_code=~\"5..\"}[5m])) / clamp_min(sum(rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\"}[5m])), 1e-9)"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "type": "stat",
      "title": "1C. Latência P95 Atual (SLA)",
      "description": "95% das requisições respondem abaixo deste tempo. Puxado para cima pelos cenários de I/O (até 3s) e Banco (até 1.5s).",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 5, "w": 8, "x": 16, "y": 5 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "decimals": 2,
          "thresholds": {
            "mode": "absolute",
            "steps": [
              { "color": "green", "value": null },
              { "color": "orange", "value": 1.0 },
              { "color": "red", "value": 2.0 }
            ]
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "reduceOptions": { "calcs": ["lastNotNull"] },
        "colorMode": "value",
        "graphMode": "area"
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2A. Distribuição de Tráfego por Cenário (fast, io, db, cpu)",
      "description": "Mostra a proporção em tempo real de cada cenário sendo executado na API de pagamento.",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "reqps",
          "custom": {
            "drawStyle": "bars",
            "stacking": { "mode": "normal" },
            "fillOpacity": 85
          }
        },
        "overrides": [
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "fast" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "green", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "io" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "yellow", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "db" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "red", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          },
          {
            "matcher": { "id": "byName", "options": "cpu" },
            "properties": [{ "id": "color", "value": { "fixedColor": "purple", "mode": "fixed" } }]
          }
        ]
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "table", "placement": "bottom", "calcs": ["mean", "lastNotNull"] },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "multi" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "sum by (scenario) (rate(http_server_requests_total{route=\"/payment\"}[1m]))",
          "legendFormat": "{{scenario}}"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 6,
      "type": "timeseries",
      "title": "2B. Latência P95 + Exemplars Clicáveis (Ponte Métrica ➔ Trace)",
      "description": "Passe o mouse sobre os losangos (Exemplars) e clique no link do Tempo para abrir o Trace exato da requisição!",
      "datasource": { "type": "prometheus", "uid": "prometheus" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 8, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 10 },
      "fieldConfig": {
        "defaults": {
          "unit": "s",
          "custom": {
            "lineWidth": 2,
            "fillOpacity": 15,
            "showPoints": "always"
          }
        },
        "overrides": []
      },
      "options": {
        "legend": { "displayMode": "list", "placement": "bottom" },
        "tooltip": { "mode": "single" }
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(traces_spanmetrics_latency_bucket{service=\"payment\",span_kind=\"SPAN_KIND_SERVER\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 via Tempo SpanMetrics (Clique nos losangos ★)",
          "exemplar": true
        },
        {
          "refId": "B",
          "expr": "histogram_quantile(0.95, sum by (le) (rate(http_server_request_duration_seconds_bucket{route=\"/payment\"}[5m])))",
          "legendFormat": "P95 via Aplicação FastAPI",
          "exemplar": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 7,
      "type": "logs",
      "title": "3. Logs de Alerta e Erro em Tempo Real (Loki — Apenas Anomalias)",
      "description": "Filtra apenas WARNING e ERROR. Clique em qualquer linha para expandir e ver o botão que abre o Trace no Tempo!",
      "datasource": { "type": "loki", "uid": "loki" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 12, "x": 0, "y": 18 },
      "options": {
        "showTime": true,
        "showLabels": true,
        "wrapLogMessage": true,
        "dedupStrategy": "none",
        "sortOrder": "Descending",
        "enableLogDetails": true
      },
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "expr": "{service_name=~\"payment|checkout\"} |~ \"Payment gateway high latency detected|Database connection timeout - pool exhausted|Fraud check exceeded CPU budget|Payment failed\""
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": 8,
      "type": "flamegraph",
      "title": "4. Continuous Profiling — Onde a CPU está sendo gasta? (Pyroscope)",
      "description": "Procure pela barra 'run_heavy_fraud_check'. Note que o time.sleep dos cenários 'io' e 'db' não consome CPU!",
      "datasource": { "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "pyroscope" },
      "gridPos": { "h": 11, "w": 12, "x": 12, "y": 18 },
      "links": [
        {
          "title": "Abrir Flamegraph em Tela Cheia (Explore)",
          "url": "/explore?schemaVersion=1&orgId=1&panes=%7B%22pyro%22%3A%7B%22datasource%22%3A%22pyroscope%22%2C%22queries%22%3A%5B%7B%22refId%22%3A%22A%22%2C%22datasource%22%3A%7B%22type%22%3A%22grafana-pyroscope-datasource%22%2C%22uid%22%3A%22pyroscope%22%7D%2C%22queryType%22%3A%22profile%22%2C%22profileTypeId%22%3A%22process_cpu%3Acpu%3Ananoseconds%3Acpu%3Ananoseconds%22%2C%22labelSelector%22%3A%22%7Bservice_name%3D%5C%22payment%5C%22%7D%22%7D%5D%7D%7D",
          "targetBlank": true
        }
      ],
      "targets": [
        {
          "refId": "A",
          "datasource": { "type": "grafana-pyroscope-datasource", "uid": "pyroscope" },
          "queryType": "profile",
          "profileTypeId": "process_cpu:cpu:nanoseconds:cpu:nanoseconds",
          "labelSelector": "{service_name=\"payment\"}"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}